### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### List users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Send welcome (replace USER_ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID",
  "templateSlug": "welcome",
  "channels": ["email", "push", "sms", "inapp"],
  "priority": "high",
  "idempotencyKey": "welcome-demo-1"
}

### Password reset
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID",
  "templateSlug": "password-reset",
  "data": { "code": "482911", "minutes": 15 }
}

### Scheduled shipment alert
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID",
  "templateSlug": "order-shipped",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-08-30T20:00:00.000Z",
  "data": { "orderId": "A-100", "carrier": "DHL", "tracking": "1Z999" }
}

### Inbox
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inbox/USER_ID

### Metrics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/metrics

### Failed jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/failed-jobs
